<title>PORTUGAL: Telecel to announce H1 results Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Telecel to announce H1 results Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese mobile phone operator Telecel-Comunicacoes Pessoais said it would announce its first half results on Wednesday, July 23, at 0700 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
